<BaseLayout title="Cookie policy" description="Information about cookies and analytics on the Enfield Zimbabwe website."><PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Cookie policy" intro="This website is designed to work with minimal browser storage." /><section class="section"><div class="container legal prose"><h2>Essential technologies</h2><p>Security and form-protection services may use essential cookies or similar technologies to distinguish legitimate visitors from automated abuse.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Optional analytics should only be enabled after Enfield has selected a provider and completed the appropriate consent and privacy review. No analytics identifier is hardcoded into this project.</p><h2>Managing cookies</h2><p>You can control or remove cookies using your browser settings. Blocking essential security features may prevent the enquiry form from working.</p><p class="legal-note">Draft placeholder — review the final deployed technology stack and obtain legal approval before production use.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
